<title>BARBADOS: CRICKET-CLOSE OF PLAY SCORES IN RED STRIPE MATCHES.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-CLOSE OF PLAY SCORES IN RED STRIPE MATCHES.</headline>
<dateline>BRIDGETOWN, Barbados 1997-01-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Close of play scores</p>
<p>on the second day of four-day Red Stripe cricket matches on</p>
<p>Sunday:</p>
<p>In Port of Spain: Trinidad and Tobago 302; Windward Islands</p>
<p>140 (Rajendra Dhanraj 4-18).</p>
<p>In Bridgetown: Guyana 156; Barbados 448-8 (Floyd Reifer 151</p>
<p>not out).</p>
<p>In Anguilla: Jamaica 223-8 v Leeward Islands.</p>
</text>
